	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Ante hunc diem ad te scribere non potui, optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quia <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>certo nihil cognovi de statu <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> et vagorum rumorum omnes <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>regiones de <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> plenę sunt, adeoque hęc, quia vera credo, communico.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p18554">Maria</persName>, imperatoris <persName>Caroli</persName> consobrina, <persName ref="p18554">Anglię regina</persName> omnium <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ordinum regni consensu pronunciata et comprobata est, quod <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ut fęlix faustumque universo <persName>Anglie regno</persName> sit, deus faxit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l2590">Northumbrianus</placeName> dux, qui proneptem <persName ref="p8375">Henrici octavi</persName> pię memorie <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>desponsatam suo filio quarto genito una cum filiis quinque et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fratre in arcem <placeName ref="l296">Londoniensem</placeName> captivus perductus est et preter e<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>os alii quindecim, inter quos sunt comites Daroye et Huntinydon Mountigen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Chieff Iustes, marchio unus <placeName ref="l2957">Northamptonus</placeName>, episcopus <placeName ref="l296">Londoniensis</placeName>, doctores du<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>o iter <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><persName ref="p591">Checus</persName> (infęlix et miserandus iuvenis) et equites sex.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Aliquot eorum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>metuo parricidii et veneficii in dominum suum et pientissimum regem reos <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>esse, in quos nulla supplicia satis acerba et crudelia excogitari poterunt <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vel a <persName>Busiride</persName> vel a Phalaride.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">De hac tragędia quęcunque post<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>hac rescivero (horrenda et immania, ut metuo) tibi significabo.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Cęsar contra <persName>Gallum</persName> decrevit bellum persequi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Oratores Anglici, qui <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad utrunque principum missi erant pacis reparande causa, propediem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>domum redibunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Marchio <placeName ref="l1048">Brandenburgensis</placeName> novas contraxit <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>copias et equitum et peditum ad milia viginti et denunciavit duci <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName>Brunswicensi</placeName> iam tribus legittimis filiis et uno notho orbato, ut <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>apparet se in bellum; nam se propediem ei iustum pręlium oblaturum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et nuper concursum habitum vix velitationis nomine dignum esse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Audimus imperatorem instare apud marchionem et ducem <placeName ref="l1041">Brunswicensem</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>et apud <placeName ref="l361">Nurenbergenses</placeName> quoque, ut armis positis bonis viris <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>transactionem et pacificationem controversiarum inter se permittant <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et ut militem sibi universum tradant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Verum an hoc impetr<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>aturus sit, nondum satis scio; nam Romanus rex non desinet ulcisci <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p18250">Mauritii</persName> mortem et marchionem persequi, cui una cum <persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>bellum ex professo indixit, et suspitiones plurimę sunt marchionem <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>magis hispani... in quam adhucdum appareat.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18250">Mauritio</persName> mors incommodo <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Germanie tempore accidit; hic solus inter principes auritus et oculatus <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>fuit Ulixes.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commenda me tuis generis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Pro libello misso gratiam <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>habeo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">15. augusti 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/><persName ref="p8121">C[<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>hristophorus] M[ontius</persName>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse vor 883]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Eruditione et pieta<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>te eximio d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>amico inter primos obse<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>rvando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p3z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zeürg</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
